Ball Person was added in '''Beta 30.0''' as a 4/4/4. '''Beta 34.0''' dropped both its Cost and ATK to 3. '''Beta 36.1''' removed its Dust of silencing all enemy monsters, leaving it with its Magic of silencing all ally monsters. '''Beta 41.0''' gave it a new Dust, now silencing a random enemy monster. This was removed again in '''Beta 52.1'''.
[[File:Ball Person (Beta 36.1).png|thumb|212x212px|Beta 36.1]]

