== Trivia ==
* "Magic: Turn end" effects (better known as "Delay" on the UC Discord Server until it became official on Beta 51.0) were silenceable before Beta 31.0, which made this synergize well with [https://undercards.fandom.com/wiki/Burgerpants Burgerpants].
** This was later confirmed to be a bug.
